{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6cc0c980306b1bc978257993cec21d0df07b43616dddc28d09c174d8c0355518",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae9e76432c1b90a50565bc4723664037bdf9e7844ca84819ff5c0f674f069dff",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了！\n现在方便耽误您一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6675d6089c919cb09cc4d8d696a0193186f7cc82b9b1af0f491acfdc10f69909",
      "text": "嗯，没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd79254892b74e2c3fceb9aafece7f0b020dce2bbb235ad474af3a91ddc05f7a",
      "text": "刚才，我和来听故事的孩子们一起\n聊了关于星座的神话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1276db2784a3dc4584b5510b2d097431f1c28b2454a8dab2986a60eee6938063",
      "text": "虽然我讲了自己知道的故事，\n但我也想查查其他的讲给他们听……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069780ace9e7369f9dc3c21a4659ae77947c9f91855152e8770f3fb2b0b217d4",
      "text": "所以，我想问问制作人有没有什么\n推荐的故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0806f9dbda3b8d0943996bedb5d2eefaa7f66f6c457b49493dfb8a297a8d843",
      "text": "推荐天蝎座的故事！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bbc6a4ecb51784c6d9db5f7fa90576029966668c1b69f06a79dd35111bd3c13",
      "text": "天鹅座的故事怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b059ea53ad238a41ea3ad6212b611522943c157dd38493187485b4a652c6acc",
      "text": "原来如此……确实听起来很有趣！\n我稍微查查看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23a6f350ff832dc762302375be5372a2ea6138bf326a233c747e93babff32e17",
      "text": "话说回来，关于星座的神话真的\n有好多好多啊。太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e28f22c5291edae5ba9753f8c32e66f64d60726b7d7ee770548b92aa9139f11",
      "text": "感觉作为讲故事的人，我自己反倒\n忍不住沉浸其中了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8b3000db6863e996ac8161f553b1547aec9b0c6c5bf4d6690a8b27dbd08a005",
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉！我们继续讲故事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe1651b2190573da87456f505f03967d36e29b4cdefb7ad2c63af3ae1bcf542a",
      "text": "……抱歉，制作人！孩子们催着我想快点听故事，\n我就先挂了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:041ryo_402_2_4_041_02_09_b:2_4_041_02_09_b:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3421691f1d21c3b745ddfae29f7f99f3c7b0581fe6a15d4b995fde35f6fec0",
      "text": "谢谢您的推荐！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
